Anthropic's OpenAI-compatible endpoint answers response_format:
json_object with a 400 ("response_format.type: Input should be
'json_schema'"), so every model call from an installation pointed at it
failed. JSON mode is now not sent to Anthropic; any other provider that
refuses it with a 400 naming response_format is asked once more without
it and not sent it again. completeJson reads a reply wrapped in prose
(parseJsonReply), as complete already did.

Tests: packages/ai/src/jsonmode.test.ts (3), mutation checked.

